    {
      "id": "1557340189997801535",
      "type": "Default",
      "timestamp": "2026-10-07T10:33:55.277+00:00",
      "timestampEdited": null,
      "callEndedTimestamp": null,
      "isPinned": false,
      "content": "## Bonus stuff\n\nThey do laser dicing, they gave me a back of the envelope quote, the sawstreets can be super thin, but it is expensive.\n\nThey do package dicing, I showed them the PCB and they were thinking it needed to be diced until I showed it was just v-grooved. \n\n-# That's all I can think of at the moment, I have to make a meeting in 10min. I think there's more to share later",
      "author": {
